      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shannon%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Thirteen one‑room schoolhouses around Shannon were later merged into a single centralized system.",
